# Generated image derivatives. Built by `php artisan images:derive`, the same
# way /public/build is built by `npm run build` — generated assets are not
# committed in this project. `images:derive --check` fails a deploy that
# forgot, because the <x-picture> component degrades quietly to the original
# JPEG and a missed run would otherwise be invisible.
/public/assets/**/_derived/
/public/assets/derived-manifest.json
/public/assets/derived-manifest.json.lock
